data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a4", "content": "## REPORT: Social Media Data Overview (Twitter/X, Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn)\n\n### Data coverage\n- **4 connected accounts**, all under domain `example.com`: LinkedIn (created 2024), Facebook (2024), Twitter/X (2024), Instagram (newest, created May 2026)\n- Daily stats span **2024-08-06 to 2026-08-05** (up to 2 years); Instagram only has ~86 days of history since it's new\n- **345 posts total** across all platforms (2024-07-18 to 2026-07-31)\n- ⚠️ Twitter's daily follower counts are entirely null in the datalake (platform limitation) — only the lifetime snapshot (65 followers) is available, so no follower growth trend exists for Twitter\n- ⚠️ Facebook has only 4 posts and near-zero activity — any average/rate for this account is not statistically meaningful\n\n### Followers & posts by platform\n\n| Platform | Total Followers (lifetime) | Total Posts |\n|---|---|---|\n| LinkedIn | 5,000 | 255 |\n| Twitter/X | 65 | 74 |\n| Instagram | 8 | 12 |\n| Facebook | 1 | 4 |\n\n"}

