data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a19", "content": "\n\nNotable: **Paid Search** spend/traffic jumps sharply from June 2026 onward (peaked at 1,128 sessions in one week), and **Paid Social** shows two big spikes (~1,288 sessions week of 2026-06-28, ~1,254 the following week) — these align with the overall traffic surge. **AI Assistant** referrals (ChatGPT/Perplexity-type traffic) appear only from June 2026 onward — a new channel.\n\n### Top 10 pages (by pageviews, all time)\n| Page | Pageviews | Sessions |\n|---|---|---|\n| / (homepage) | 58,559 | 54,224 |\n| /lp/li-ri | 4,279 | 3,269 |\n| /customers | 3,615 | 2,950 |\n| /join | 3,259 | 2,948 |\n| /blog | 3,093 | 2,451 |\n| /careers | 2,514 | 1,970 |\n| /company | 2,314 | 2,121 |\n| /blog/meta-ads-attribution-2026-changes-fixes | 1,743 | 1,866 |\n| /waitlist | 1,429 | 1,312 |\n| /blog/meta-andromeda-explained-performance-marketers-2026 | 1,353 | 1,405 |\n\n"}

